# 根上下文构建（ci.yml/cd.yml/docker-compose context=. 或 ..）的忽略清单。
# ⚠️ 作用于所有构建——含凭证的 .env 必须排除（v0.63.1 D4）
.git
.gitignore
.codegraph
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/.venv.*
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/dist
**/logs
**/*.log
*.tar.gz
pounding-harness-shell
pounding-desktop
shopbang
archive
docs
api-integration
design-deliverables
integration-workplan
deploy/skill
deploy/*.tar.gz
browser
# v0.63.1 D4: .env 含 COS 密钥/CREDENTIAL_MASTER_KEY 等凭证, 严禁进 build context
.env
.env.*
deploy/.env
deploy/.env.bak*
worker/.env
# ✅ v0.72 防复发：预热/导出的全量缓存 JSON（数百 MB 级）严禁进 build context/镜像层
worker/assets/attribute_schemas_zh.json
worker/assets/dictionary_values_zh.json
